# Test-run artefacts from the pinned upstream suite.
#
# Deliberately placed here rather than inside upstream/figurelab/, so that the
# snapshot directory stays byte-identical to the pinned upstream revision — adding
# a file to it, even a .gitignore, would defeat the point of having a snapshot.
# No trailing slashes: during local test runs node_modules is often a SYMLINK to a
# shared install, and a trailing-slash pattern matches directories only — it would
# let the symlink itself be committed.
upstream/figurelab/tests/node_modules
upstream/figurelab/tests/test-results
upstream/figurelab/tests/playwright-report
upstream/figurelab/tests/.pdfout
upstream/figurelab/tests/.cache
